  "title": "The poor man's covered put as a mirror of the poor man's covered call",
  "summary": "The speaker's poor man's covered call is a 95 delta call with shorter-dated calls sold against it. The mirror is a poor man's covered put: a deep in-the-money long put with shorter-dated puts sold against it, for a stock that looks priced for perfection. Never use a regular covered put, because shorting stock has unlimited risk. In his 120-day model the two payoffs mirror each other.",
